{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1716273968_213418_dfb45a52fa032c228e47edee405de3ad.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Spellbound Elegance is an online boutique. We offer glamorous loungewear, sleepwear, and accessories for women.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">We use vintage styles as an inspiration for our collection. Our goal is to help women feel beautiful and confident by adding a little sophistication to their nightwear.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><o:p></o:p></span>&bull; Product description: </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We offer loungewear, sleepwear, shoes, jewelry and hair accessories.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Unlike most loungewear on the market, Spellbound Elegance products focus on the magical feeling created when wearing glamorous nightwear and jewelry.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&bull; Payment terms: </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10% commission on orders $100 or less. On orders over $100, commission is 15%. Payouts at least 20 days after order.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&bull; Other information:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Our loungewear is perfect for any occasion, whether relaxing at home, or indulging in a luxurious hotel getaway.&nbsp; We focus on showcasing your beauty and sophistication through an upscale style.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Our nightwear can be paired with our coverups, shoes, fine jewelry offerings, and hair accessories.</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri', 'sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">U.S. sales only. Free shipping to U.S. on all orders.</span><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Calibri', 'sans-serif';\"><span style=\"font-family: 'andale mono', monospace;\"></span></span></p>\r\n</div>",
